00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:32.960
Your own way to act.

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:33.960
Okay?

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:34.720
Nice.

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:36.240
So all I need now is

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:37.600
one brave heart

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:41.000
that can shout FREEDOM

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:42.280
and free itself.

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:44.840
Again, no?

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:45.960
Still no?

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:47.760
Come on, folks.

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:48.760
Come on.

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:50.840
Come on.

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:52.120
Come on, guys.

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:53.560
I don't know.

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:56.080
Okay.

00:00:56.080 --> 00:00:57.760
One and only,

00:00:57.760 --> 00:00:59.480
magnificent Gina Rose.

00:01:06.320 --> 00:01:07.880
Now, the important thing.

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:09.880
Gina,

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:12.240
