00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:19.480
Of course, you can.

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:21.160
Good. Nice.

00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:27.000
Passion,

00:01:27.160 --> 00:01:28.560
the little baby dinos,

00:01:28.680 --> 00:01:29.800
is not about banging

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:31.400
all night in the boudoir.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:33.840
Passion

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:37.440
is about restraint,

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:43.080
about taboo.

00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:54.320
I want to kiss her so much.

00:01:56.560 --> 00:01:58.440
The tension makes

00:01:59.120 --> 00:02:00.720
makes my lips tremble.
